    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d166">

                <pb facs="0290" n="124" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg124"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.51/1747</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Reinsch to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-02-15T19:00:00+08:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 15, 1917, 7 p.m</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Can you inform me concerning prospects of Chicago loan negotiations? The Chinese
                    Government is anxious to have this loan completed in order be ready for
                    eventualities.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Reinsch</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
